        "id": "ch12_5-1",
        "text": "Deploying a containerized application with Docker\nSo far, we have shown you how to use Docker and how to manage containers. Docker is so much more\nthan that, but this is enough to get you started and make you want to learn more. Docker is a great\ntool for developers as it offers a streamlined way to deploy applications by removing the necessity to\nreplicate development environments. In the next section, we will show you how to deploy a simple\nwebsite using Docker.\nEsta secci\u00f3n contiene las siguientes subsecciones\n\u2022 Deploying a website using Docker\nSi deseas explorar cualquiera de estas subsecciones, puedes pregunt\u00e1rmelo directamente.",
